{
  "_comment": [
    "Captured loot contents of the 15 static world containers (chests), recovered from the WorldObjects.KdTreeTail",
    "blob before it was retired in #410 (commit 814933ad). Decoded with LootBagMessageCodec from the container's",
    "wire trailer: [u32 len][ProtoLootBagIIR].",
    "",
    "This is a SAMPLE, not a loot table: it is whatever each chest happened to hold at the moment of capture, so it",
    "is evidence about what these containers drop, not a definition. The server does NOT persist it - a chest spawns",
    "with a clean empty scaffold and the loot system fills it (LootContainerTemplate / WithLootContents).",
    "",
    "itemId is ProtoAcgItem.Template1; name is that id resolved against the Items table at dump time (null = the id",
    "is not in Items).",
    "",
    "Consumed: these observations feed the per-map loot pool (MapLootEntries, #273), which the runtime rolls",
    "random drops from. 12 of the 15 (map,item) pairs here are in that pool; the other 3 are the map-4000",
    "chests, whose positions are SHARED with map 4010 (Stygian Galley and Tortage Island overlap on 12 world-",
    "object positions), so they are the same physical chests already covered under 4010."
  ],
